    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84152" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>measuring by feet,</i>
			= Lat. <i>pedatura,</i> Veg.<i><span class="en">
				2.7
			</span></i>: in land-surveying, Frontin. in
			<u>Corp.Agrimens.Rom.</u> i<i><span class="en">
				p.16
			</span></i> Thulin. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in
			Metric, <i>scansion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μετρικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					456.39
				</span></i>
			: hence, metaph., of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Syn.Puls.</u>
				4.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>dance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.99
			</span></i>.</div>
